  "changes": [
    "Remove the invented ActorFrame command scope around a direct NoteField DidTapNote callback. Preserve the caller scope, three arguments, optional returns and errors.",
    "Use scalar multiply then subtract for decelerate/outQuad, matching the native float rounding."
  ],
  "regression_controls": [
    "Direct tap runs at the original command depth for valid/invalid optional conversions and Lua errors; an existing caller depth is preserved.",
    "The real gameplay-owned NoteField callback queries construction scope, invokes an owned nested playcommand in callback scope, then returns to construction scope. Existing tap arguments, optional returns, life/stat writes and update order remain checked.",
    "The observed scalar deceleration percentage produces the exact native ease factor and PlayerY."
  ],
